1..the file doesn't have .git folder,so first we add this into git
    git init.....it initialize empty git repository
2.If we want add more than 1 file..that means a folder
    (git add .) use this command
3.check it is ready to commit
    git status
4.Commit it into git
    git commit -m "Created Github_practice2"
5.push it into Git
    git push origin main
    it shows no origin,bcoz we doesn't create origin in Git
6.Go to Git ,create new repository
    created,then type VS
    git remote add origin (link)https://github.com/gopikarajendran36-arch/Github_practice2.git
    git branch (that shows master)master means main
7.we want to change branch name master to main
    git branch -M main
    check...git branch (it shows main)
8.now we push it into Git
    git push origin main 
9.Create new branch in git,click main..create a new branch 
    first check here,git branch -a
    then pull,git pull
    again check,git branch -a (it shows gitbranch1)
    git checkout gitbranch1 (it shows..swtiched to a new branch)
    git branch -a (gitbranch1 and main)
10.update newfile.txt in main also
    git diff gitbranch1(it shows the diff of main & gitbarnch1)
11.merge the main and gitbranch1
    git merge gitbranch1
    git push origin main
    
    

    